    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tips. i've heard people talk about brixton and peckham being cool but i've also seen some stuff online about them being kind of rough? like, is it actually dangerous for a woman on her own, or is that just people being dramatic? i'm trying to understand why people call them \"gritty\" compared to somewhere like south ken or whatever.",
